:''Not to be confused with [[U.F.O. Cat (Rare Cat)|U.F.O. Cat]].''
'''Bird Cat''' is the 6th [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cat]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Nepal (Empire of Cats)|Nepal]] in [[Empire of Cats]]: Chapter 1 and requires 5,000 XP or a [[Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsule]] to unlock. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] doubles health and damage, gains [[Weaken]] against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]], and increases recharge time.

