==Trivia==
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]] reduced The Flying Cat's base health from 900 to 600 and base attack from 495 to 330, and increased base recharge from 250f<sup>8.33s</sup> to 370f<sup>12.33s</sup>.
*[[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] gave The Flying Cat the ability to [[Weaken]] [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]].
*The Flying Cat is a reference to Laputa from the movie [[wikipedia:Castle in the Sky|Castle in the Sky]].
*Bird Cat and Superfeline are the only Normal Cats that have increased attack power from Normal Form to Evolved Form.
**It is also the only Normal Cat that has a shorter foreswing in Normal Form than Evolved/True Form.
***[[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] are the opposite: longer foreswing in Normal Form.
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Bird Cat's descriptions read as follows:
